  <revision rev="5" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>d15267a568750ee3125b9320e815d8d4</srcmd5>
    <version>4.4.0</version>
    <time>1794838465</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 4.4.0:
  * Support Python 3.14 and 3.15 and remove Python 3.9 support
  * Add comprehensive directive support to DSL module
  * Feature dsl schema shortcuts
  * Support HTTP multipart subscriptions in AIOHTTPTransport
  * show oneOf in introspection query
  * Add `extra_args` parameter to subscribe() for aiohttp transport
  * Add extensions support to GraphQLRequest
  * Feature support httpx2
  * Fix DeprecationWarning in test_requests_batch online tests
  * Don't fall back to Apollo when not in subprotocols
  * DSL using immutable graphql-core AST classes
  * Support standard http.cookiejar.CookieJar in RequestsHTTPTransport
    cookies typing
  * Fix gql to work with graphql-core 3.3.0rc0
  * Skip multipart parts with empty Content-Type instead of raising
  * Coerce a single value to a list when serializing list variables
  * Refactor DSL code to use Self type
  * Fix python 3.9 dev dependencies
  * Replace archived backoff with tenacity
- Drop patch tests.patch, included upstream.</comment>
    <requestid>1397808</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
